sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as Operator
    participant Manager as manager service
    participant Store as local JSON registry
    participant Docker as Docker Compose
    participant Tenant as Microsoft 365 tenant
    participant Cloudflare as Cloudflare tunnel

    Operator->>Manager: Create tenant instance
    Manager->>Store: persist settings + instance metadata
    Manager->>Docker: download compose files and start stack
    Manager->>Tenant: register app / consent / Graph permission checks
    Tenant-->>Manager: tenant credentials accepted
    Manager->>Docker: initialize Prowler provider and schedule
    Manager->>Cloudflare: publish hostname if configured
    Cloudflare-->>Operator: public URL available
    opt Azure row action
        Operator->>Manager: sign in as subscription Owner / UAA
        Manager->>Tenant: assign Reader + ProwlerRole on each subscription (ARM)
        Manager->>Docker: register azure providers in Prowler
    end
